[al:新概念英语第一册]
[ti:51. A Pleasant Climate]
[00:00.960]Lesson 51. | 第51课。
[00:04.060]Where do you come from? | 你来自哪里？
[00:07.435]I come from Greece. | 我来自希腊。
[00:09.375]What's the climate like in your country? | 你们国家气候怎么样？
[00:12.085]It's very pleasant. | 非常宜人。
[00:14.245]What's the weather like in spring? | 春天的天气怎么样？
[00:17.470]It's often windy in March. | 三月经常刮风。
[00:19.960]It's always warm in April and May, | 四月和五月总是很暖和，
[00:23.170]but it rains sometimes. | 但有时会下雨。
[00:25.470]What's it like in summer? | 夏天怎么样？
[00:27.500]It's always hot in June, July and August. | 六月、七月和八月总是很热。
[00:31.250]The sun shines every day. | 每天都阳光明媚。
[00:34.205]Is it cold or warm in autumn? | 秋天是冷还是暖和？
[00:37.240]It's always warm in September and October. | 九月和十月总是很暖和。
[00:40.710]It's often cold in November, | 十一月通常很冷，
[00:43.260]and it rains sometimes. | 有时会下雨。
[00:46.725]Is it very cold in winter? | 冬天很冷吗？
[00:50.695]It's often cold in December, January and February. | 十二月、一月和二月通常很冷。
[00:54.980]It snows sometimes. | 有时会下雪。